                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>Sunlight causes the sangoi to partially fade from view, growing feeble and translucent. While exposed to direct sunlight, the sangoi is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Concealed], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Clumsy]{Clumsy 1}, and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Enfeebled]{Enfeebled 1}.</p>"
